    <div class="wb-note">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><path d="M12 2L3 7v6c0 5.25 3.75 10.1 9 11 5.25-.9 9-5.75 9-11V7l-9-5z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg>
      <p><strong>Where your input goes.</strong> The local MCP process handles non-model utility functions on your machine; tools marked <code>net</code> contact their documented destinations. The hosted MCP worker receives tool arguments and may be covered by ordinary hosting/security logs. Do not send sensitive input without checking the selected tool's route.</p>
